= JVM: fill the op gaps -- uniprop-general, p6capturelexwhere, ord, sink
uniprop-general answers the category name; p6capturelexwhere is ported
from try-capture-lex-callers and the phaser, exit-handler and attribute
forks that waited on it and on captureinnerlex come down; ords reads one
codepoint per surrogate pair; a container is not sunk.
